# Realm-specific debate scenes: classes, specs, camps and pride. Specialization names are checked
# against the world database; the arguments are period knowledge in new words.

@kind debate

# ======================= Midgard =======================
@realm mid

@topic mid_main_healer
@levels 20-50
@scene healer_or_shaman
@role B class=Healer
@role C class=Shaman
@role D type=*
A: {q} healer or shaman for a group's main heals?
B: healer. bigger heals, group heals, and pac mez on top
C: shaman heals fine and the debuffs make every fight shorter
B: shorter fights do not matter if the tank falls over
C: with my debuffs the tank takes half the damage anyway
D: take both and stop arguing, you two are the best pair in midgard
A: fair, healer and shaman it is

@topic cave_shaman
@levels 20-50
@scene cave_shaman
@role B class=Shaman
@role C type=*
A: is a cave shaman just a dps class that can heal a bit?
B: subterranean is diseases and damage over time, it changes the whole fight
C: groups want heals from a shaman, not dots
B: groups want things dead. a diseased target heals for less
C: tell that to the tank at a quarter health
A: maybe half and half? mending and cave

@topic skald_role
@levels 20-50
@scene skald_role
@role B class=Skald
@role C type=NoLifer,Leveler
A: are skalds just speed bots with axes?
B: battlesongs is more than speed, the shouts hurt
C: in a group the speed is the reason we invite you
B: i know, and i will play it, but let me swing sometimes
C: swing all you want, just keep the song up
A: speed on, axes out. everyone happy

@topic thane_identity
@levels 20-50
@scene thane_identity
@role B class=Thane
@role C type=*
A: is a thane a tank or a caster?
B: both. stormcalling hits hard and i can still take a beating
C: jack of all trades, master of none
B: the master of none still kills you while you think about it
C: fair, the lightning is no joke
A: thane life sounds fun honestly

@topic zerker_savage
@levels 20-50
@scene zerker_or_savage
@role B class=Berserker
@role C class=Savage
@role D type=*
A: zerker or savage for a new alt?
B: zerker, two axes and berserk style, classic midgard
C: savage, the self buffs and hand to hand are the new hotness
B: those buffs eat your own health
C: and the extra swings make up for it
D: either way you will die first, it is tradition
A: lol. savage, i want to try the new class

@topic bonedancer
@levels 20-50
@scene bonedancer
@role B class=Bonedancer
@role C type=NoLifer
A: bonedancers in the frontier, good or just lag?
B: three pets doing damage while i stay safe, good
C: kill the commander and the army falls apart
B: then i resummon from behind the wall
C: and we are back to lag
A: bring the army, i like the chaos

@topic sm_rm
@levels 35-50
@scene sm_or_rm
@role B class=Spiritmaster
@role C class=Runemaster
A: spiritmaster or runemaster for a group?
B: spiritmaster, the pet tanks and keeps the adds off us
C: runemaster, the damage is the reason fights end
B: fights end faster when nobody gets added on
C: fights end fastest when the target is already dead
A: one of each then, perfect

@topic shadowblade_weapons
@levels 20-50
@scene sb_weapons
@role B class=Shadowblade
@role C type=*
A: left axe or two-handed for a shadowblade?
B: left axe, the extra swings stack the poison faster
C: the big two-hander opener drops casters before they move
B: one big hit, then you are just a weak fighter in the open
C: one big hit is all you need on a caster
A: left axe, i like stabbing a lot

@topic warrior_boring
@levels 20-50
@scene warrior_boring
@role B class=Warrior
@role C type=Daredevil
A: are warriors the most boring class in midgard?
B: boring is the group never dying because i hold everything
C: you hit buttons and get hit, where is the excitement
B: the excitement is watching you live because of me
C: ok that is a good comeback
A: respect the warrior

@topic mid_40s
@levels 38-50
@scene spindel_or_varulv
@role B type=Leveler
@role C type=Explorer,Daredevil
A: spindelhalla or varulvhamn for the 40s?
B: spindelhalla, the halls are packed with camps and the xp is steady
C: varulvhamn, fewer groups fighting over the same pulls
B: fewer groups because the wolves hit like trains
C: and drop like trains too
A: spindel tonight, varulv when i am braver

@topic aegir
@levels 30-50
@scene aegir_or_classic
@role B type=Explorer
@role C type=Leveler
A: anyone level on aegir or is it all spindelhalla?
B: aegir is gorgeous and the camps are empty, try iarnwood
C: empty because the old camps are proven
B: proven and crowded. i like having a camp to myself
C: i like knowing exactly what i will get
A: trying gripklosa this weekend, will report back

# ======================= Albion =======================
@realm alb

@topic cleric_spec
@levels 20-50
@scene smite_or_rejuv
@role B class=Cleric
@role C type=*
@role D class=Armsman,Paladin,Mercenary,Reaver
A: smite cleric or rejuv cleric?
B: smite, i can solo and still heal the group
C: rejuv, a group needs heals more than another damage dealer
D: as the guy getting hit, i vote rejuv
B: you would vote for anything that keeps you alive
D: correct
A: rejuv for groups, smite for solo, settled

@topic armsman_weapon
@levels 20-50
@scene polearm_or_twohand
@role B class=Armsman
@role C type=NoLifer
A: polearm or two handed on an armsman?
B: polearm, the reach and the styles feel right
C: two handed has better follow-ups in some fights
B: both hit like a falling tree, honestly
C: and both need a cleric behind you
A: polearm it is, i like the reach

@topic paladin
@levels 20-50
@scene paladin_worth
@role B class=Paladin
@role C type=Leveler
A: is a paladin worth inviting over another fighter?
B: the chants carry the whole group, endurance alone wins long fights
C: the damage is low though
B: the damage is low because i am busy keeping you running
C: twisting chants is hard to do well
A: a good paladin is gold then

@topic necromancer
@levels 20-50
@scene necro
@role B class=Necromancer
@role C type=NoLifer,Daredevil
A: necromancers, overpowered or just strange?
B: strange. i am the pet, the pet is me, everyone is confused
C: confused until the shade drains them to nothing
B: and then someone kills the pet and i am a ghost in a robe
C: fair, it is a weird class
A: the new classes are all weird and i love it

@topic albion_casters
@levels 35-50
@scene wiz_or_sorc
@role B class=Wizard
@role C class=Sorcerer
@role D class=Theurgist
A: best caster in albion, go
B: wizard. fire, earth, cold, things die from across the room
C: sorcerer. i mez the room, then your fire actually lands
D: theurgist. my pets do the job while you two argue
B: pets die to one area spell
D: and come right back
A: so the answer is all three, with a cleric

@topic minstrel
@levels 20-50
@scene minstrel
@role B class=Minstrel
@role C type=*
A: are minstrels a speed bot or a real class?
B: speed, mez, charm, and a sword. very real class
C: in a group i mainly want the speed though
B: i know. i also want respect
C: here is your respect, now speed please
A: lol, sing on

@topic reaver_merc
@levels 20-50
@scene reaver_or_merc
@role B class=Reaver
@role C class=Mercenary
